<title>BRAZIL: Telemig Jan-July 1996 net 134.5 mln reais.</title>
<headline>Telemig Jan-July 1996 net 134.5 mln reais.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Minas Gerais-based telecom firm Telemig sent the following statement to the stock exchanges on its results for the January to July period.</p>
<p>				Jan-July 1996</p>
<p>    Net profit		 134.549 million</p>
<p>    Net revenue		592.421 million</p>
<p>    Net worth		  1.682 bln</p>
<p>Note: All figures in Brazilian reais. No comparative figures were provided.</p>
<p>-- Fatima Cristina, Sao Paulo newsroom, 55-11-2324411</p>
</text>
